</node>
<node id="Battle Positions">
  <data key="d0">Battle Positions</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Designated locations where subordinate units move before the entire unit terminates the offense.&lt;SEP&gt;Defensive locations that require significant engineer support and specific classes of supply for construction and operation.&lt;SEP&gt;Locations planned in depth by commanders to support flexibility and the use of reserves.&lt;SEP&gt;Defensive locations selected to maximize mutual support through observation and monitoring of intervening ground.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-abe3f08fafe8b7389e20d639ffaa8692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16fb9a43ba23b08191569577e00618b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3345760dcbfb2262ee6ddfa43b1677ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43a1cd0ab6021273635c13e3b7af3476</data>
