</node>
<node id="Echelon Support Area">
  <data key="d0">Echelon Support Area</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">An area established by echeloning sustainment assets forward.&lt;SEP&gt;A specific support area where units are positioned and where the support area commander coordinates security and operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-abe3f08fafe8b7389e20d639ffaa8692&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4e12f4d30fc2f3059510d3457b00e7b</data>
