<node id="Sustainment">
  <data key="d0">Sustainment</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The provision of logistics, personnel services, and health service support to enable tactical momentum in the offense.&lt;SEP&gt;Sustainment involves addressing unique considerations such as the replenishment of ammunition and obstacle construction materials.&lt;SEP&gt;Sustainment refers to capabilities and nodes vital to rear area operations that enemy forces threaten and special operations forces degrade.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71131e902d37087dc65113f52eae4eb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d61f4b5597bdee4add1bccdba2cbd3ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d90513532ac94b30a700a8204e509e17</data>
