<node id="Lines Of Communications">
  <data key="d0">Lines Of Communications</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Supply routes that lengthen as an operation progresses, requiring security for units and convoys.&lt;SEP&gt;Routes and infrastructure used for logistical support and movement, protected during area security operations.</data>
