  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Aerial Resupply">
  <data key="d0">Aerial Resupply</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A method of delivering critical supplies used when ground lines of communication are absent or insecure, such as during raids.&lt;SEP&gt;Aerial resupply is a method of sustainment for isolated units attacking deeper into enemy territory.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-71131e902d37087dc65113f52eae4eb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d85f7f19b9f147f37bc741a7c59d700</data>
