  <data key="d0">Scheme of Maneuver</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The scheme of maneuver is a planning element used by commanders to establish air defense priorities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scheme of Maneuver is a plan element that the fire support chain must understand to coordinate effectively.</data>
