<node id="Delay">
  <data key="d0">Delay</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">A tactical operation where units yield ground to gain time while retaining flexibility to inflict maximum damage on enemy forces without becoming decisively engaged.&lt;SEP&gt;Delay is a variation of retrograde where a force under pressure trades space for time by slowing down the enemy's momentum.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7d8387d6c63026bf8e7495c788ece1b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ef422907967635431abf4581ffee5bb8</data>
