<node id="22 FEB 2022">
  <data key="d0">22 FEB 2022</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">22 FEB 2022 is the publication date listed on the document header.&lt;SEP&gt;The publication date of the document ATP 3-06.1.&lt;SEP&gt;The publication date of the military manual ATP 3-06.1/MCRP 3-20.4/NTTP 3-01.04/AFTTP 3-2.29.&lt;SEP&gt;22 FEB 2022 is the publication date of the manual ATP 3-06.1/MCRP 3-20.4/NTTP 3-01.04/AFTTP 3-2.29.&lt;SEP&gt;The publication date associated with the military manual ATP 3-06.1/MCRP 3-20.4/NTTP 3-01.04/AFTTP 3-2.29.&lt;SEP&gt;The publication date associated with the military manual ATP 3-06.1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dfe3e79800d49e6c15cc7d1d7485cab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8dbf8d99e2395e386c1df16f3ddc745&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c503bd64404512328ab83ccc0ba0997e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da2039fcc410ab417ea95cf892f406c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d765189e92be25ee08b9a34a1f6fb186&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02c0ca8e3a28d2a5576fbc54974744ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb60400466a6008ca4dd586ce73558f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ff2850046e68e7092903c98bb6595e</data>
