  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Air Assaults engage enemy forces or seize key terrain using assault forces moved by rotary-wing or tiltrotor aircraft.&lt;SEP&gt;Military operation involving insertion of forces where enemy may identify potential LZs and emplace obstacles.</data>
