  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Aircraft are used in urban environments for ISR and escort operations, with effectiveness influenced by altitude and terrain.&lt;SEP&gt;Vehicles including rotary-wing, tiltrotor, and fixed-wing assets used for air movement and evacuation.&lt;SEP&gt;Air vehicles used in urban operations that may require firing solutions for moving vehicles.</data>
