</node>
<node id="ATP 3-06.1">
  <data key="d0">ATP 3-06.1</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">ATP 3-06.1 is a publication addressing planners and tactical operators considerations for urban aviation operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Military publication referenced in the header regarding Urban Operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Military publication referenced in the text containing tactics and procedures for urban operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c503bd64404512328ab83ccc0ba0997e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39bd2e6c05ba9ec2683ab1b01bd4603d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d765189e92be25ee08b9a34a1f6fb186</data>
