  <data key="d2">MCRP 3-20.4 is a publication listed alongside ATP 3-06.1 in the document header.&lt;SEP&gt;Marine Corps Reference Publication referenced in the header alongside ATP 3-06.1 regarding Urban Operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Marine Corps publication referenced alongside ATP 3-06.1 for urban operations.</data>
