  <data key="d2">NTTP 3-01.04 is a publication listed alongside ATP 3-06.1 in the document header.&lt;SEP&gt;Navy Tactics, Techniques, and Procedures publication referenced in the header regarding Urban Operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Navy publication referenced alongside ATP 3-06.1 for urban operations.</data>
