  <data key="d0">Link 16</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Link 16 is a battle-tracking capability that planners should integrate.&lt;SEP&gt;Link 16 is a specific digital data link system used for target handover and digital marking methods.</data>
