<node id="Department of Defense">
  <data key="d0">Department of Defense</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Organization providing forces, civilians, contractors, and assets for Defense Support of Civil Authorities.&lt;SEP&gt;Lead federal agency after the shift from the Department of State during conflict context.</data>
