</node>
<node id="Sensors">
  <data key="d0">Sensors</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Sensors are integrated assets used for collection, with fidelity and field of view affected by slant range and altitude.&lt;SEP&gt;Assets operated and synchronized as part of ISR planning and operation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-94b0f13f75f0bd64d503a14651482e66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb60400466a6008ca4dd586ce73558f</data>
