<node id="ATP 3-06.1/MCRP 3-20.4/NTTP 3-01.04/AFTTP 3-2.29">
  <data key="d0">ATP 3-06.1/MCRP 3-20.4/NTTP 3-01.04/AFTTP 3-2.29</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">ATP 3-06.1/MCRP 3-20.4/NTTP 3-01.04/AFTTP 3-2.29 is a multi-service military manual publication dated 22 FEB 2022. This document serves as a comprehensive doctrinal guide focused primarily on urban operations. It provides essential guidance and considerations for conducting military activities within urban environments, outlining specific characteristics of the operational landscape. The manual details various building types, building characteristics, structure characteristics, and urban zones, while also addressing street patterns relevant to maneuvering and planning.

Beyond environmental factors, the publication covers a wide range of tactical and operational procedures. It includes doctrine for air assault, aviation missions, and airspace control, alongside specific techniques for weapon delivery and laser designation. Ground operations are addressed through guidelines on movement, evacuation, attack techniques, and escort planning. The document further incorporates intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance (ISR) protocols, as well as procedures for personnel recovery and humanitarian assistance. Additionally, the manual provides tactics on deception and camouflage to support mission effectiveness within complex urban settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-dfe3e79800d49e6c15cc7d1d7485cab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a14acea44dac3d3616369b19ec0f2146&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8dbf8d99e2395e386c1df16f3ddc745&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da2039fcc410ab417ea95cf892f406c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32189ba42b4061e42fcfd89b6143133c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b14fece49276b354d02ce9679408699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b470a806dd10d8280c0cdf136820189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-446c344294ac1157381c690e0f0b5d6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94b0f13f75f0bd64d503a14651482e66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-410889a9720065d35de43976293caee3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02c0ca8e3a28d2a5576fbc54974744ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb60400466a6008ca4dd586ce73558f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63ff2850046e68e7092903c98bb6595e</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\ARN34839-ATP_3-06.1-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778751507</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
