</node>
<node id="Operation Iraqi Freedom">
  <data key="d0">Operation Iraqi Freedom</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">A U.S.-led coalition operation in 2003 involving operations in northern Iraq.&lt;SEP&gt;A past operation whose identified issues regarding space, weight, and power informed M1A2 SEPv3 development.&lt;SEP&gt;Operation Iraqi Freedom was a conflict where GMLRS rockets were utilized extensively for field artillery support.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5ada7ac41ab629e1f7809edf7d62800b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd09d5c1d391b2d64517a5d72254efc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6faa94aab2e13591315f79ebbd49ab0</data>
