</node>
<node id="Navy">
  <data key="d0">Navy</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Provided air support for Task Force Viking operations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Navy is one of the military branches whose requirements are met by the HMS tactical radio systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Navy requires networking tactical radio systems that meet specified interoperability requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5ada7ac41ab629e1f7809edf7d62800b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6faa94aab2e13591315f79ebbd49ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-278d433e3502ea4bdab16646b23bed0b</data>
