  <data key="d2">A lightweight, highly mobile, diesel-powered four-wheel drive tactical vehicle family also known as HMMWV.&lt;SEP&gt;Current armored vehicle platform that the Joint Light Tactical Vehicle aims to replace.&lt;SEP&gt;Vehicle used to transport Universal Ground Control Stations for the Shadow system.&lt;SEP&gt;A combat platform employed for TOW missiles mounted with the Improved Target Acquisition System.&lt;SEP&gt;Vehicle platform (HMMWV) employed with Improved Target Acquisition System for mounting TOW missiles.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acade8ec9a9d5344060a4314cfa18a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e07adaae816a485b8bdcdde27baecf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d02d8715ba139ee7e2b9f2ae7c7d9bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4b4ce335843ab582068db841084575c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dcb0d8a5efb5ce308ca2c93988c72be</data>
