  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A rocket system whose munitions are launched by HIMARS and shares development for a common fire control system.&lt;SEP&gt;A weapon system listed in the context of United States Army modernization and inventory.&lt;SEP&gt;A full-spectrum, combat-proven, tracked precision strike weapon system organic to Field Artillery Brigades.&lt;SEP&gt;Platform used to fire the Precision Strike Missile, also known as MLRS.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acade8ec9a9d5344060a4314cfa18a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3473302fed80b78e94b810b62c26e3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15fb7baa23082d86c7d6fc25d3cc0e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e097e89b46e0363b0e3141cd6e6f7d1</data>
