  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">An air transport aircraft capable of transporting the HIMARS launcher for rapid deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;The C-130 is a transport aircraft capable of carrying the HIMARS weapons system.&lt;SEP&gt;Aircraft capable of internal transport of the Joint Light Tactical Vehicle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acade8ec9a9d5344060a4314cfa18a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dcb0d8a5efb5ce308ca2c93988c72be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef40d1e9a5996f2179f1b53a42ee90d</data>
