<node id="European Deterrence Initiative">
  <data key="d0">European Deterrence Initiative</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The European Deterrence Initiative requires support through the purchase and deployment of current FMTV A1P2 configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;European Deterrence Initiative is an initiative associated with Army Preposition Stock and ABCT fielding in specific regions.&lt;SEP&gt;An initiative under which 16 HIMARS units were deployed to Europe during 3QFY17.&lt;SEP&gt;An initiative involving the deployment of MLRS launchers to Europe in Fiscal Years 17 and 18.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acade8ec9a9d5344060a4314cfa18a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c4507fc3a4f571c8dfbaa23d9a738cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15fb7baa23082d86c7d6fc25d3cc0e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f976415bdf294d82666a68528ec01480</data>
