  <data key="d2">PEO Combat Support And Combat Service Support manages the Family of Medium Tactical Vehicles and is based at Detroit Arsenal.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization linked to Detroit Arsenal overseeing the HMMWV program.&lt;SEP&gt;Oversees the Joint Light Tactical Vehicle program.&lt;SEP&gt;A Program Executive Office responsible for support of the MRAP vehicles, associated with Detroit Arsenal.</data>
