<node id="Next Generation Combat Vehicles">
  <data key="d0">Next Generation Combat Vehicles</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Next Generation Combat Vehicles is a designated modernization priority of the United States Army and is identified as one of the six modernization priorities identified by the United States Army for long-range improvement. Within the organizational framework, it is classified as a TACA Modernization Priority within the United States Army and operates as a designated modernization priority within the United States Army acquisition strategy. This category serves as a strategic modernization priority aimed at upgrading future land combat platforms and functions as a modernization priority focus area for the United States Army focused on future vehicle technology.

The initiative encompasses a modernization priority category encompassing upgrades to platforms like the Bradley Fighting Vehicle and includes a modernization priority category within the United States Army that encompasses the Stryker program. Additionally, Next Generation Combat Vehicles involves the upgrade of fleets such as the HEMTT and is aligned with the development of future Abrams tank variants. As a priority area of Army Modernization, it focuses on developing the next generation of armored and light tactical combat vehicles. It acts as an Army modernization priority focused on upgrading ground combat vehicles through efforts focused on upgrading combat vehicle fleets and capabilities. Serving as a designated modernization priority for the Army alongside long-range precision fires, this program ensures progress through its modernization priority category focusing on future vehicle advancements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-663e6d2263b508d6a68885919457bd03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-acade8ec9a9d5344060a4314cfa18a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd09d5c1d391b2d64517a5d72254efc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c4507fc3a4f571c8dfbaa23d9a738cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e07adaae816a485b8bdcdde27baecf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d02d8715ba139ee7e2b9f2ae7c7d9bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e04593a83987ff6eb98f28906bbd37f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4a15c71581af907f47533c1630b8096&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dcb0d8a5efb5ce308ca2c93988c72be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6faa94aab2e13591315f79ebbd49ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3473302fed80b78e94b810b62c26e3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15fb7baa23082d86c7d6fc25d3cc0e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a7ca33dacb79b2456dfa0debe68053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d121313ed4af44c28824fd63c5a94377&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f976415bdf294d82666a68528ec01480&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef40d1e9a5996f2179f1b53a42ee90d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adaee111f19e7fd13f315f0ca1141b82</data>
