<node id="Long-Range Precision Fires">
  <data key="d0">Long-Range Precision Fires</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Long-Range Precision Fires is a designated strategic modernization priority identified by the United States Army. It operates as one of the six modernization priorities established to drive long-range improvement and enhance deep strike capabilities within the service. This focus area concentrates on advancing long-range precision fire capabilities, emphasizing extended engagement ranges and specific extended range missile technology to improve overall strike potential.

The scope of Long-Range Precision Fires includes critical weapon systems such as the GMLRS, HIMARS, and Hellfire. Furthermore, this priority influences the strategic direction of significant platform initiatives, including the Abrams tank program, and is regularly cited alongside next generation combat vehicle requirements. Categorized as a TACA Modernization Priority, it dictates that supporting technologies, including radio systems, must satisfy specific operational requirements. Collectively, these elements define Long-Range Precision Fires as a central modernization priority area aimed at strengthening fire capabilities and expanding engagement reach for the United States Army.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acade8ec9a9d5344060a4314cfa18a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd09d5c1d391b2d64517a5d72254efc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c4507fc3a4f571c8dfbaa23d9a738cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e07adaae816a485b8bdcdde27baecf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d02d8715ba139ee7e2b9f2ae7c7d9bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e04593a83987ff6eb98f28906bbd37f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4a15c71581af907f47533c1630b8096&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4b4ce335843ab582068db841084575c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e0c57d3e73a6d0c3b1cbe5a2f59e546&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dcb0d8a5efb5ce308ca2c93988c72be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6faa94aab2e13591315f79ebbd49ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3473302fed80b78e94b810b62c26e3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15fb7baa23082d86c7d6fc25d3cc0e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a7ca33dacb79b2456dfa0debe68053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-278d433e3502ea4bdab16646b23bed0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d121313ed4af44c28824fd63c5a94377&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f976415bdf294d82666a68528ec01480&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef40d1e9a5996f2179f1b53a42ee90d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adaee111f19e7fd13f315f0ca1141b82</data>
