  <data key="d0">Acquisition Life Cycle Phase</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Acquisition Life Cycle Phase defines stages like Materiel Solution Analysis and Production &amp; Deployment for programs.&lt;SEP&gt;Acquisition Life Cycle Phase outlines the stages of development from Materiel Solution Analysis to Operations and Support.&lt;SEP&gt;Process framework including stages like Materiel Solution Analysis and Production And Deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;Stages governing weapon system development including Materiel Solution Analysis and Production.&lt;SEP&gt;A structured process involving stages from Materiel Solution Analysis to Operations and Support for Army programs.</data>
