<node id="Redstone Arsenal">
  <data key="d0">Redstone Arsenal</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Redstone Arsenal is a significant military installation located in Alabama that serves as a central hub for United States Army acquisition and modernization efforts. The facility functions as both a base and headquarters for two major executive offices: the Program Executive Office Aviation (PEO Aviation) and the Program Executive Office Missiles and Space (PEO Missiles and Space). As a primary location for these organizations, Redstone Arsenal hosts their respective operations and manages various defense modernization programs essential to national security infrastructure.

Within its scope of aviation oversight, Redstone Arsenal is the location associated with PEO Aviation operations and the management of Future Vertical Lift initiatives. The site is also linked to the administration of specific aerial systems, notably the RQ-7Bv2 Shadow system. These responsibilities highlight the arsenal's integral role in advancing aviation technologies and maintaining readiness through dedicated program management within the PEO Aviation framework.

Concurrently, regarding PEO Missiles and Space, Redstone Arsenal acts as the headquarters and operational location responsible for Integrated Air and Missile Defense (IAMD) activities. The facility oversees a diverse portfolio of programs, including the management of the PAC-3 program, the AN/TPQ-53 program, and handling HIMARS description specifications. Furthermore, the arsenal provides critical oversight for unmanned systems and rocketry, specifically the MQ-1C Gray Eagle and the Guided Multiple Launch Rocket System (GMLRS). Through these combined functions, Redstone Arsenal stands as a pivotal site for the development, specification, and management of critical defense assets across both aviation and missile domains.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-acade8ec9a9d5344060a4314cfa18a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc1b95a684a1e8d5c4b01db867ca78af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c4507fc3a4f571c8dfbaa23d9a738cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e07adaae816a485b8bdcdde27baecf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d02d8715ba139ee7e2b9f2ae7c7d9bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e04593a83987ff6eb98f28906bbd37f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4a15c71581af907f47533c1630b8096&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cb3d0930de98ddce6ed3ada6a6c40cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-503de8a915400d2e62dbb9df698d826a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dcb0d8a5efb5ce308ca2c93988c72be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6faa94aab2e13591315f79ebbd49ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-15fb7baa23082d86c7d6fc25d3cc0e12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d121313ed4af44c28824fd63c5a94377&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f1c7260e4a898eeeb86c6568add6249&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ef40d1e9a5996f2179f1b53a42ee90d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e097e89b46e0363b0e3141cd6e6f7d1</data>
