<edge source="Enemy Force" target="Commanders">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Commanders maneuver forces to create dilemmas that prevent the enemy force from reacting in an organized fashion.&lt;SEP&gt;Commanders should not wait too long to transition operations as the enemy force approaches its culminating point.</data>
  <data key="d9">conflict,tactical assessment,tactical strategy,timing</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-b6bf6abab46637a933d4adcc9ec578f4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a418b78a90bc5acb3f47736189745955</data>
