  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Enemy Force" target="Defending Force">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Defending forces maintain security and disrupt enemy attacks to seize the initiative.&lt;SEP&gt;The defending force conducts operations to disrupt the enemy force's plan and degrade command and control capabilities.&lt;SEP&gt;Defending forces contain and counterattack enemy forces if they succeed in landing.</data>
  <data key="d9">containment,counterattack,degradation,disruption,engagement</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-adabd6aa6271efdc850feccf7016cdf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-069de81fea4e6c37c85bab0a5a971f89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43a1cd0ab6021273635c13e3b7af3476</data>
