  <data key="d9">construction,resource requirement</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-7d8387d6c63026bf8e7495c788ece1b3</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747346</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Strong Point" target="Brigade">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Brigades may construct strong points, although companies and battalions normally occupy them.</data>
  <data key="d9">construction,defense</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-16fb9a43ba23b08191569577e00618b7</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747350</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Strong Point" target="Platoon">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Commanders do not normally establish strong points for units of platoon size because they cannot secure a large enough perimeter.</data>
  <data key="d9">defense,exclusion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-16fb9a43ba23b08191569577e00618b7</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747351</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Strong Point" target="Squad">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Commanders do not normally establish strong points for units of squad size because they cannot secure a large enough perimeter.</data>
  <data key="d9">defense,exclusion</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-16fb9a43ba23b08191569577e00618b7</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747351</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Engagement Area" target="Defending Force">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Defending forces draw enemy forces into engagement areas to initiate combat on favorable terms.</data>
  <data key="d9">combat,tactical maneuver</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-adabd6aa6271efdc850feccf7016cdf0</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747350</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Defense" target="Disruption">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Disruption is a characteristic of the defense used to desynchronize enemy preparations.</data>
  <data key="d9">characteristic,doctrine</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-3345760dcbfb2262ee6ddfa43b1677ad</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747358</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Defense" target="Flexibility">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Flexibility is a characteristic of the defense involving plans that anticipate enemy actions.</data>
  <data key="d9">characteristic,planning</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-3345760dcbfb2262ee6ddfa43b1677ad</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747359</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Defense" target="Maneuver">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Maneuver is a characteristic of the defense used to place enemy forces in a position of disadvantage.</data>
  <data key="d9">characteristic,tactics</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-3345760dcbfb2262ee6ddfa43b1677ad</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747359</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Defense" target="Mass and Concentration">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Mass and concentration is a characteristic of the defense used to produce overwhelming combat power.</data>
  <data key="d9">characteristic,combat power</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-3345760dcbfb2262ee6ddfa43b1677ad</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747359</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Defense" target="Operations in Depth">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Operations in depth is a characteristic of the defense involving simultaneous combat power application.</data>
  <data key="d9">characteristic,operational scope</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-3345760dcbfb2262ee6ddfa43b1677ad</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747360</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Defense" target="Preparation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Preparation is a characteristic of the defense where forces occupy and improve positions before an attack.</data>
  <data key="d9">characteristic,readiness</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-3345760dcbfb2262ee6ddfa43b1677ad</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747360</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Defense" target="Security">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">Security is a characteristic of the defense used to protect forces from surprise.</data>
  <data key="d9">characteristic,protection</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-3345760dcbfb2262ee6ddfa43b1677ad</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747361</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Defense" target="Retrograde Operations">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">If a defense is unsuccessful, commanders transition the force into retrograde operations.</data>
  <data key="d9">contingency,failure response</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-2ac9465c9d545f87eb3a80e932a498f3</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\ARN34828-ADP_3-90-000-WEB-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1778747368</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Main Battle Area" target="Defending Force">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">The Main Battle Area includes the area where the defending force counterattacks to defeat enemy forces.&lt;SEP&gt;A defending force is less effective when an attacking enemy force can deploy in combat formations within the Main Battle Area.</data>
  <data key="d9">counterattack,deployment,effectiveness,location</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-adabd6aa6271efdc850feccf7016cdf0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-069de81fea4e6c37c85bab0a5a971f89</data>
