<edge source="Next Generation Combat Vehicles" target="United States Army">
  <data key="d7">9.0</data>
  <data key="d8">In the context of the relationship between Next Generation Combat Vehicles and the United States Army, the initiative is fundamentally characterized as a critical component of military development. The United States Army lists Next Generation Combat Vehicles as a core modernization priority, ensuring its integration throughout the organization. This status is reaffirmed across various official contexts, where the program is identified as a key modernization priority within the United States Army enterprise and explicitly noted in the service's strategic plan.

Further detailing the operational impact, Next Generation Combat Vehicles serves as a designated modernization priority specifically intended for upgrading ground combat systems. The United States Army identifies this program as essential for fleet upgrades, underscoring its necessity for maintaining technological superiority. Additionally, the initiative carries the specific classification of a key TACA Modernization Priority. These consistent descriptors collectively establish Next Generation Combat Vehicles as a focal point of the United States Army’s modernization efforts, bridging strategic planning with tangible improvements to ground forces.</data>
  <data key="d9">defense planning,modernization focus,modernization goal,modernization priority,modernization strategy,priority,strategic focus,strategic planning,strategic priority,strategy</data>
  <data key="d10">chunk-acade8ec9a9d5344060a4314cfa18a5b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c4507fc3a4f571c8dfbaa23d9a738cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e07adaae816a485b8bdcdde27baecf8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d02d8715ba139ee7e2b9f2ae7c7d9bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dcb0d8a5efb5ce308ca2c93988c72be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6faa94aab2e13591315f79ebbd49ab0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3473302fed80b78e94b810b62c26e3a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a7ca33dacb79b2456dfa0debe68053e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d121313ed4af44c28824fd63c5a94377</data>
  <data key="d11">D:\Academic resources\WEAPON_SYSTEMS_HANDBOOK.pdf</data>
